&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;３．簡便法を適用した確定給付制度&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(1) 簡便法を適用した制度の、退職給付に係る負債の期首残高と期末残高の調整表&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:436pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（百万円）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:18pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:465.0pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
